{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_015jNP8sMoyvUax5Sk3kJAGj", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diocese_of_San_Jose_(Nueva_Ecija)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diocese_of_San_Jose_de_Antique\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.ucanews.com/directory/dioceses/philippines-san-jose-nueva-ecija/407\"}, {\"url\": \"https://partnernews.mambu.com/default.aspx/B13U0N/999564/Diocese\"}, {\"url\": \"https://heraldry-wiki.com/wiki/Diocese_of_San_Jose_de_Antique\"}, {\"url\": \"https://gcatholic.org/churches/local/zjos1\"}, {\"url\": \"https://mail.catholic-hierarchy.org/diocese/dsjda.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://goodhome.co.ke/^99423794/bhesitates/icelebratev/rintervenef/san+jose+santo.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://dev.studyabroadfoundation.org/default.aspx/B13U0N/999564/Diocese\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:46:35.213Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "菲律宾圣若瑟教区 设立 天主教 Diocese of San Jose Philippines established", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_012VzLEmpKeCMLDggnew9JXq", "content": [{"title": "Diocese of San Jose (Nueva Ecija)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diocese_of_San_Jose_(Nueva_Ecija)"}, {"title": "Diocese of San Jose de Antique", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diocese_of_San_Jose_de_Antique"}, {"title": "Support Asian Catholic Dioceses Directory", "url": "https://www.ucanews.com/directory/dioceses/philippines-san-jose-nueva-ecija/407"}, {"title": "Diocese Of San Jose Nueva Ecija", "url": "https://partnernews.mambu.com/default.aspx/B13U0N/999564/Diocese Of San Jose Nueva Ecija.pdf"}, {"title": "Diocese of San Jose de Antique", "url": "https://heraldry-wiki.com/wiki/Diocese_of_San_Jose_de_Antique"}, {"title": "Diocese of", "url": "https://gcatholic.org/churches/local/zjos1"}, {"title": "Catholic-Hierarchy DC", "url": "https://mail.catholic-hierarchy.org/diocese/dsjda.html"}, {"title": "goodhome.co.ke", "url": "https://goodhome.co.ke/^99423794/bhesitates/icelebratev/rintervenef/san+jose+santo.pdf"}, {"title": "Diocese Of San Jose Nueva Ecija", "url": "https://dev.studyabroadfoundation.org/default.aspx/B13U0N/999564/Diocese Of San Jose Nueva Ecija.pdf"}]}, "找到两个名为\"圣若瑟\"（San Jose）的菲律宾天主教教区，结果里没有专门针对中文问题的内容，以下按英文来源整理。\n\n**1. 圣若瑟教区（Nueva Ecija，新埃西哈省）**\n- 该教区由教宗若望保禄二世设立，正式按教会法设立的日期是1984年7月14日。维基百科信息框中却写的是1984年2月16日，两处日期不一致。\n- 它是从卡巴纳图安教区（Diocese of Cabanatuan）的辖区中划分出来的，最初包含十六个堂区，原属卡巴纳图安的四十一个堂区。\n- 现任主教是Samuel Naceno Agcaracar, S.V.D.，任期自2025年11月21日起（来源：GCatholic）。\n\n**2. 安蒂克圣若瑟教区（Antique，安蒂克省）**\n- 维基百科称其成立于1962年6月18日。\n- 另一来源称其1962年以圣若瑟德安蒂克领地主教区（Territorial Prelature）的形式建立，1982年升格为教区。Catholic-Hierarchy则给出升格日期为1982年11月15日（Elevated: 15 November 1982）。\n\n**需要注意：** 两个教区的具体设立日期在不同来源中有出入。如需确定，建议查阅梵蒂冈官方网站或菲律宾天主教主教团的公告。"], "durationSeconds": 7.812223749999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_015jNP8sMoyvUax5Sk3kJAGj", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
